				},
				{
					"id": 730740303,
					"content": "「縱使那是鋪滿火的道路，也要歡歌前行…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740304,
					"content": "「縱使那日的月色，如同垂死之獸的眼眸…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740305,
					"content": "「因為我們確是生命之谷的居民，因為我們確是勇敢的種子。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740306,
					"content": "這就是…我們找到的歌嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740307,
					"content": "「因為有想要結實的石榴，因為有想要盛放的薔薇。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740308,
					"content": "「遙遠而比鄰的天空…永不終結的約定…一定會歸還夢的籠城。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740309,
					"content": "…嗯。原來如此，我大致明白了。只要有蘭雅瑪的歌，就能消除前往覺樹之堂通路上的阻礙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740310,
						730740312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740310,
					"content": "我也明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730740311,
					"content": "#欸？{F#妳}{M#你}明白了什麼…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740313,
					"content": "當然是蘭雅瑪的歌。嗯，還是說，不是蘭那羅的話，沒那麼容易聽懂…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740314,
					"content": "嗯，不管怎麼說，蘭陀娑，你先回去準備無憂節吧？覺樹之堂交給我就好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740315,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740316,
					"content": "#我和{NICKNAME}也一起去！畢竟，說好了要幫忙拿到恆素果的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740317,
					"content": "「…一定要歡歌前行。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740312,
					"content": "怎麼明白的…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740313
					]
				}
			]
		},
